  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Transfecting Cultured Hippocampal Neurons with an Actin-GFP Plasmid (2007) in Cold Spring Harbor Protocols. 3 citations.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Transfecting Cultured Hippocampal Neurons with an Actin-GFP Plasmid (2007) in Cold Spring Harbor Protocols is authored by Andrew Matus, Virginie Biou and Heike Brinkhaus. Topics: Transfection, Hippocampal formation, Green fluorescent protein, Cell biology and In vitro.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">3 citations (OpenAlex). Citations peaked in 2013 with 1 citing works. Citing venues include Cell, Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences and Neuroscience Research.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Limited online visibility beyond citations.</p>",
